@startuml
[*] --> Draft : User starts typing

Draft --> Sent : User presses Send
Draft --> [*] : User clears text

Sent --> Delivered : Server acknowledges & \n routes to recipient
Sent --> Failed : Network error / Timeout

Failed --> Sent : Auto-retry / Manual retry
Failed --> [*] : Message deleted

Delivered --> Read : Recipient opens chat window
Read --> [*]
@enduml